  "prefLabel": "Pda 515.01 Change in Position May Be Ordered",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 515.01 Change in Position May Be Ordered. The chief harbor master or designee shall at any time order any vessel at anchor to change position when, in the chief harbor master or designee’s opinion, such vessel is so anchored as to impede navigation or to endanger other vessels.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
